      "content": "urgency care feels like a lot for just a small burn though... i really don't want to deal with the wait or the cost if i can avoid it. if i just keep it clean and maybe put some antibiotic ointment or even just some coconut oil on it to keep the skin from drying out, can i be sure it'll heal fine on its own? i'm pretty sure i can manage this at home.",
